{"meta":{"id":"git-submodule","category":"it/server/infra/deploy","title":"Git 서브모듈","subtitle":"","summary":"git submodule 사용법","tags":["git","submodule"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"blog: code/back/Git_submodule.jsx","updatedAt":"2023년 8~9월쯤"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>GIT</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2023년 8~9월쯤</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">Git 서브모듈</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> git submodule 사용법</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">1. 서브모듈 추가와 업데이트</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">git submodule add [서브모듈_레파지토리] [연결경로]\r\n//예시 : git submodule add 서브모듈.git 서브모듈_path\r\n\r\ngit submodule update\r\n// 1. 커밋 : 서브모듈 디렉터리를 그 커밋 상태로 이동(체크아웃)\r\n// 2. 브랜치 : .gitmodules에 서브모듈 branch = main을 설정 , main으로 가장 최근에 커밋된 커밋 해시\r\n//  =&gt; git submodule update  --remote  “원격 저장소의 main 브랜치 최신 커밋”을 가져와 그 커밋으로 체크아웃</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">2. 서브모듈 삭제 후 오류 (already exists in the index)</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">//서브 모듈 지웠는데 애러 ...\r\n//already exists in the index\r\ngit ls-files --stage 서브모듈_path\r\ngit rm -f --cached 서브모듈_path\r\n//예시 : git rm -f --cached 폴더1/서브모듈\r\n#fatal: Please stage your changes to .gitmodules or stash them to proceed\r\ngit submodule deinit 서브모듈_path\r\n\r\n\r\n//참고\r\n//서브모듈의 캐시 확인\r\ngit ls-files --stage 서브모듈_path</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/deploy/git-submodule","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"deploy","title":"Docker · Git","path":"it/server/infra/deploy"}],"hasImage":false}